ng%3E+The+introductory+boxes+%28like+the+current+Recruit%2FUltimate+starter+sets%29+are+Space+Marines+vs.+Tyranids+or+Space+Marines+vs.+Necrons+%E2%80%94+so+the+cheapest+way+into+the+game+already+hands+you+half+an+army.%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EThey+forgive+mistakes.%3C%2Fstrong%3E+Marines+are+tough%2C+hit+reliably%2C+and+have+decent+armour+saves.+When+you+misplay+%E2%80%94+and+you+will+%E2%80%94+your+army+doesn%27t+evaporate.%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EEndless+free+resources.%3C%2Fstrong%3E+More+tutorials%2C+army+lists%2C+painting+guides+and+community+advice+exist+for+Space+Marines+than+any+other+faction+combined.%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3ESimple+colour+schemes.%3C%2Fstrong%3E+A+blue%2C+green+or+red+armour+scheme+with+a+wash+and+a+highlight+looks+great+with+beginner-level+skills.%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3C%2Ful%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EBest+for%3A%3C%2Fstrong%3E+players+who+want+to+learn+the+rules%2C+meet+people+at+their+local+store%2C+and+never+worry+about+%22did+I+pick+wrong%3F%22%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Ch3%3EHow+to+start+Space+Marines%3C%2Fh3%3E%0A%3Col%3E%0A%3Cli%3EBuy+a+starter+box+%28cheapest+way+to+get+models%2C+dice%2C+ruler+and+rules+in+one+purchase%29.%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3EAssemble+10%E2%80%9315+models%2C+paint+them+with+a+simple+3-colour+scheme+%E2%80%94+don%27t+chase+%22golden+demon%22+quality+yet.%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3EPlay+small+games+%28500+points%29+to+learn+movement%2C+shooting+and+charge+rules.%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3EExpand+to+1%2C000+points+with+one+box+of+Intercessors+and+one+vehicle.%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3C%2Fol%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Ch2%3EPick+%232%3A+Necrons+%E2%80%94+The+Cool+Alternative%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Cp%3EIf+%22generic+super+soldiers%22+doesn%27t+excite+you%2C+Necrons+are+the+best+beginner+army+in+the+game+on+pure+value%3A%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cul%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3ESimple+rules%2C+durable+models.%3C%2Fstrong%3E+Reanimation+protocols+let+you+shrug+off+damage+%E2%80%94+very+forgiving+while+you%27re+learning.%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3ESkeleton+robots+paint+fast.%3C%2Fstrong%3E+A+silver+basecoat%2C+green+accents+and+a+wash+gets+you+a+table-ready+army+in+a+weekend.+Perfect+for+new+painters.%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EStrong+start+boxes.%3C%2Fstrong%3E+The+Necrons+half+of+the+main+starter+set+alone+gets+you+a+legal+combat+patrol-sized+force.%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EThey+look+incredible+on+a+shelf.%3C%2Fstrong%3E+Let%27s+be+honest+%E2%80%94+glowing+green+eyes+and+living-metal+heroes+are+a+huge+motivation+boost.%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3C%2Ful%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EBest+for%3A%3C%2Fstrong%3E+hobbyists+who+want+an+army+that+looks+finished+with+minimal+painting+skill%2C+and+players+who+like+resilient%2C+no-nonsense+armies.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Ch3%3EHow+to+start+Necrons%3C%2Fh3%3E%0A%3Col%3E%0A%3Cli%3EGrab+the+Necrons+half+of+a+starter+set+%28or+a+Necrons+combat+patrol+box%29.%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3EPaint+a+test+model+first%3A+spray%2C+leadbelcher-style+basecoat%2C+green+glow+accents%2C+black+wash.%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3EPlay+500-point+games+%E2%80%94+Necron+durability+hides+beginner+errors.%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3EAdd+a+big+centre-piece+%28a+Monolith+or+C%27tan%29+once+you+hit+1%2C000+points.%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3C%2Fol%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Ch2%3EWhich+Should+%3Cem%3EYou%3C%2Fem%3E+Pick%3F%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Cfigure+class%3D%22wp-block-table%22%3E%3Ctable%3E%3Cthead%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Cth%3EYou+want...%3C%2Fth%3E%3Cth%3EPick%3C%2Fth%3E%3C%2Ftr%3E%3C%2Fthead%3E%3Ctbody%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%3EThe+%22correct%22+default%2C+maximum+community+support%2C+easiest+start%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3E%3Cstrong%3ESpace+Marines%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Ftd%3E%3C%2Ftr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%3ESomething+visually+striking+that+still+plays+simple%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3E%3Cstrong%3ENecrons%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Ftd%3E%3C%2Ftr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%3ETo+build+both+over+time%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3EStart+Marines%2C+add+Necrons+later+%E2%80%94+their+starter+boxes+share+rules%2C+dice+and+terrain%3C%2Ftd%3E%3C%2Ftr%3E%3C%2Ftbody%3E%3C%2Ftable%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%0A%3Cp%3EThere+is+no+wrong+answer+between+these+two.+Both+are+top-tier+beginner+armies%3B+pick+the+one+whose+models+make+you+want+to+paint+tonight.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Ch2%3EFAQ+%E2%80%94+Best+Warhammer+40K+Army+for+Beginners%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EWhat+is+the+easiest+Warhammer+40K+army+for+a+complete+beginner%3F%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3ESpace+Marines.+They%27re+tough+in-game%2C+easy+to+build+and+paint%2C+and+every+starter+product+is+designed+around+them.+Necrons+are+a+close+second+with+simpler+model+counts+and+fast+paint+schemes.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EIs+Warhammer+40K+expensive+for+beginners%3F%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3EYou+can+start+for+roughly+%24100%E2%80%93150+with+a+starter+box%2C+clippers%2C+glue+and+3%E2%80%934+paint+pots.+That+covers+your+first+playable+500-point+games.+Expanding+to+1%2C000+points+adds+another+%2480%E2%80%93150+over+a+few+months.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EShould+I+pick+my+army+based+on+looks+or+rules%3F%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3ELooks.+Rules+change+with+every+balance+dataslate%3B+you%27ll+be+painting+and+staring+at+these+models+for+years.+Both+Marines+and+Necrons+pass+the+rules+test+anyway%2C+so+pick+the+aesthetic+you+love.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EHow+long+does+it+take+to+paint+a+first+army%3F%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3EA+simple+500-point+army+%28about+15%E2%80%9320+models%29+takes+a+beginner+10%E2%80%9315+hours+with+a+basic+basecoat%2Fwash%2Fhighlight+scheme.+Batch-painting+one+unit+at+a+time+makes+this+painless.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3ECan+I+play+Space+Marines+and+Necrons+together%3F%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3ENot+in+the+same+list%2C+but+you+can+absolutely+collect+both+%E2%80%94+many+hobbyists+do.+Starter+boxes+for+both+armies+come+with+the+same+core+rules%2C+so+nothing+is+wasted.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EAre+Necrons+good+for+beginners+in+2026%3F%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3EYes+%E2%80%94+simple+army+rules%2C+durable+models%2C+forgiving+reanimation+mechanics+and+one+of+the+fastest+paint+schemes+in+the+game+make+them+one+of+the+two+best+beginner+picks.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Ch2%3EStart+Your+First+Army+Today%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Cul%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%F0%9F%91%89+%3Cstrong%3E%3Ca+href%3D%22%2Fhow-to-start-warhammer-40k%2F%22%3EHow+to+Start+Warhammer+40K%3A+The+Complete+Beginner%27s+Roadmap%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fstrong%3E+%E2%80%94+your+first+30+days%2C+step+by+step%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%F0%9F%91%89+%3Cstrong%3E%3Ca+href%3D%22%2Fspace-marines-beginner-army-guide%2F%22%3ESpace+Marines+Army+Guide%3A+Units%2C+Boxes+and+First+1%2C000+Points%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%F0%9F%91%89+%3Cstrong%3E%3Ca+href%3D%22%2Fnecrons-beginner-army-guide%2F%22%3ENecrons+Army+Guide%3A+The+Easiest+Non-Marine+Start%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%F0%9F%91%89+%3Cstrong%3E%3Ca+href%3D%22%2Fbest-warhammer-40k-starter-set%2F%22%3EBest+Warhammer+40K+Starter+Set+in+2026+%28Compared%29%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3C%2Ful%3E%0A%3Cblockquote+class%3D%22wp-block-quote%22%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EReady+to+roll+dice%3F%3C%2Fstrong%3E+Grab+a+starter+box%2C+paint+your+first+five+models+badly%2C+and+book+a+500-point+game+at+your+local+store.+That%27s+the+whole+onboarding.+%3Cstrong%3E%3Ca+href%3D%22%2Fbest-warhammer-40k-starter-set%2F%22%3ESee+the+best+starter+sets+%E2%86%92%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fblockquote%3E%0A%3Chr+class%3D%22wp-block-separator+has-alpha-channel-opacity%22%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cem%3EGrimdark+Builds+is+an+unofficial+fan+site.+Warhammer+40%2C000+is+a+trademark+of+Games+Workshop.+This+site+is+not+affiliated+with+or+endorsed+by+Games+Workshop.%3C%2Fem%3E%3C%2Fp%3E&status=publish